---
import Header from '../components/Header_shop.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <html lang="en">
    <head>
      <meta charset="utf-8" />
      <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
      <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
      <title>About Us | Tagbreak</title>

      <!-- Google Fonts -->
      <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
      <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
      <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Abel&family=Aldrich&family=Changa:wght@200..800&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet"
      />

      <style>
        :root {
          --green: #1E4941;
          --bg-light: #f2f2f2;
          --text-dark: #000000;
          --max-width: 1100px;
        }

        body {
          margin: 0;
          font-family: 'Abel', sans-serif;
          background-color: var(--bg-light);
          color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        .about-wrapper {
          max-width: var(--max-width);
          margin: 0 auto;
          padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
        }

        /* HERO */
        .about-hero {
          text-align: center;
          margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .about-hero h1 {
          font-family: 'Aldrich', sans-serif;
          letter-spacing: 0.15em;
          color: var(--text-dark);
          font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
          margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .about-hero p {
          max-width: 750px;
          margin: 0 auto;
          font-size: 1.1rem;
          line-height: 1.8;
        }

        /* SECTIONS */
        .about-section {
          margin-top: 3rem;
          display: grid;
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 2rem;
        }

        .about-section.full {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .about-section h2 {
          font-family: 'Changa', sans-serif;
          color: var(--text-dark);
          font-weight: 500;
          letter-spacing: 0.08em;
          text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .about-section p {
          font-size: 1.05rem;
          line-height: 1.9;
        }

        /* HIGHLIGHT BLOCKS */
        .highlight-box {
          background: #ffffff;
          padding: 2rem;
          border-left: 6px solid var(--green);
        }

        /* CONTACT */
        .contact-box {
          margin-top: 3rem;
          text-align: center;
          padding: 1rem;
          background: #ffffff;
          padding-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .contact-box p {
          margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .contact-box a {
          color: #000000;
          text-decoration: none;
          font-weight: 600;
        }

        .contact-box a:hover {
          color: var(--green);
        }

        /* RESPONSIVE */
        @media (min-width: 768px) {
          .about-section {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
          }
        }
      </style>
    </head>

    <body>
      <Header />

      <main class="about-wrapper">
        <!-- HERO -->
        <section class="about-hero">
          <h1>ABOUT US</h1>
          <p>
            It began with a thought that a scarf could be more than just fabric.
            That it could hold art, innovation, and emotion within a single fold.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- STORY -->
        <section class="about-section">
          <div>
            <p>
              At <strong>Tagbreak</strong>, every scarf tells a story of design,
              craft, and quiet rebellion against the ordinary. Founded by two
              21-year-olds driven by detail, discovery, and design, we create
              limited-edition scarves, only six pieces per design each carrying
              its own identity within one of five vivid themes.
            </p>

            <p>
              Every Tagbreak scarf begins as real artwork, shaped by human
              imagination and expertise. From hand-drawn illustrations and
              intricate prints to textures inspired by India's diverse artistry,
              each element comes together in Bangalore, where every piece takes
              its final form.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="highlight-box">
            <p>
              The fabric is as thoughtful as the art it holds. Crafted from
              plant-based Ecotech material, it blends luxury with responsibility -
              soft, fluid, and enduring. It feels as good as it looks: mindful,
              yet modern.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- INNOVATION -->
        <section class="about-section">
          <div class="highlight-box">
            <p>
              We've reimagined how scarves are worn, replacing traditional knots
              with a magno-snap system that keeps every edge smooth, every line
              unbroken, and every gesture refined. The result is elegance that
              moves effortlessly, preserving the design's natural flow.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p>
              Our world is framed in deep green - a tone that stands for balance,
              quiet strength, and renewal. It's the soul of Tagbreak, reflected in
              our designs, our vision, and our commitment to building beauty that
              lasts.
            </p>

            <p>
              Beneath every fold lies a small piece of tomorrow - a QR-linked NFT,
              your digital certificate of authenticity and ownership. Every
              Tagbreak scarf exists both in your hands and on the blockchain: a
              phygital collectible bridging art, fashion, and technology.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- COMMITMENT -->
        <section class="about-section full">
          <h2>Our Commitment</h2>
          <p>
            Tagbreak upholds recognized international standards of social and
            environmental responsibility across all its operations. From
            selecting and tracing raw materials to designing and crafting our
            products, we prioritize a circular approach focused on quality and
            durability.
          </p>

          <p>
            Through continuous innovation and optimization of our production
            processes, we strive to minimize the environmental footprint of our
            business and supply chain. As part of this commitment, we consciously
            avoid traditional silk, choosing not to harm silkworms, and instead
            embrace innovative, plant-based Ecotech fabrics that uphold our
            cruelty-free, sustainable, and forward-thinking values.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- CONTACT -->
        <section class="contact-box">
          <p>For more information, please contact</p>
          <a href="mailto:tagbreak.cult@gmail.com">
            tagbreak.cult@gmail.com
          </a>
        </section>
      </main>

      <Footer />
    </body>
  </html>
</Layout>
